---
// Second bold editorial statement section placed immediately after "Why Build With PCB Indonesia"
// Statement: "ENGINEERED FOR WHAT’S NEXT."
// Animation composition: Words appear sequentially + clip-path reveal + subtle scale settling
---

<section
  data-statement-section-2
  class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#07694B] text-white py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-44 border-y border-[#055B41] select-none"
>
  <!-- Subtle Industrial Copper Dot Pattern -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08] pointer-events-none"
    style="background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px;"
  />

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8 sm:space-y-12">
    <!-- Top Technical Specification Badge -->
    <div
      data-statement-2-meta
      class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-brand-100/90 tracking-wider pb-6 border-b border-white/15"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white animate-pulse" />
        <span class="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white">02 // EDITORIAL STATEMENT</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-brand-100/75">
        <span>MISSION-CRITICAL ARCHITECTURE</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">•</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">SCHEMATIC TO MASS SILICON</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Editorial Quote Composition: Sequential Words with Clip-Path & Subtle Scale -->
    <div
      data-statement-2-quote-container
      class="relative py-4 sm:py-6"
    >
      <!-- Subtle Background Decorative Quote Icon -->
      <span
        data-quote-mark-2
        class="absolute -top-10 -left-6 sm:-top-16 sm:-left-12 font-serif text-7xl sm:text-9xl text-white/10 pointer-events-none select-none font-bold leading-none"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        “
      </span>

      <!-- Primary Oversized Typography Block -->
      <blockquote class="relative z-10 m-0 p-0">
        <h2
          class="font-extrabold uppercase font-display tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.08] flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 sm:gap-x-5 lg:gap-x-7"
          style="font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 6.8vw, 6.25rem);"
        >
          <!-- Word 1: ENGINEERED -->
          <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden py-1">
            <span
              data-statement-2-word
              data-i18n-en="“Engineered"
              data-i18n-id="“Dirancang"
              class="inline-block will-change-transform"
            >
              “Engineered
            </span>
          </span>

          <!-- Word 2: FOR -->
          <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden py-1">
            <span
              data-statement-2-word
              data-i18n-en="For"
              data-i18n-id="Untuk"
              class="inline-block will-change-transform"
            >
              For
            </span>
          </span>

          <!-- Word 3: WHAT'S -->
          <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden py-1">
            <span
              data-statement-2-word
              data-i18n-en="What’s"
              data-i18n-id="Masa"
              class="inline-block will-change-transform"
            >
              What’s
            </span>
          </span>

          <!-- Word 4: NEXT. -->
          <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden py-1">
            <span
              data-statement-2-word
              data-i18n-en="Next.”"
              data-i18n-id="Depan.”"
              class="inline-block will-change-transform text-white"
            >
              Next.”
            </span>
          </span>
        </h2>
      </blockquote>

      <!-- Editorial Narrative Underline Subtitle -->
      <p
        data-statement-2-subtext
        data-i18n-en="Accelerating domestic hardware development with sub-millimeter precision, end-to-end traceability, and zero offshore customs bottlenecks."
        data-i18n-id="Mempercepat pengembangan hardware dalam negeri dengan presisi sub-milimeter, keterlacakan penuh, dan bebas kendala impor luar negeri."
        class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-100/90 font-mono max-w-2xl leading-relaxed"
      >
        Accelerating domestic hardware development with sub-millimeter precision, end-to-end traceability, and zero offshore customs bottlenecks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Technical Metadata & Pipeline Footnote -->
    <div
      data-statement-2-footer
      class="pt-6 border-t border-white/15 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-xs text-brand-100/80"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="text-white font-bold">[ PIPELINE INTEGRITY ]</span>
        <span class="hidden md:inline text-brand-100/60">—</span>
        <span class="hidden md:inline">24H PROTOTYPES • 100K+ MASS VOLUME • 100% IPC CLASS 3 TESTING</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase text-white/90 font-semibold">
        <span>IPC-A-600/610 STANDARDS</span>
        <span class="text-white/40">•</span>
        <span>INDONESIAN ENGINEERING</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
